# Privacy Policy

## Data Collection

- No data is transmitted to the developer or third parties; data is stored locally unless exported.
- No usage data is collected.
- No diagnostics or analytics data is collected.

## Data Use

- No data is used for device or user tracking.
- No data is used for advertising.

## Data Sharing

- No data is shared with any third parties.

## Data Storage

- All app data remains on your device.
- Data leaves your device only if you explicitly export, share it, or save a file in your cloud storage.
- This app does not use cloud storage.

## Third-Party Services

- This app does not use third-party SDKs, services, or tracking technologies.

## Connectivity

- This app does not connect to external servers.

## Children’s Privacy

- The app does not collect any user information from users of any age.

## Changes

- This policy may be updated; any changes will be posted here.
